# Only the reviewed sources may reach the image. The patterns apply at every depth: a git-ignored file (bytecode
# in aegis_dp/__pycache__, an env file, a key) does not show in `git status`, yet would otherwise be copied, and
# Python prefers a .pyc whose header matches the source over the source itself.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/.env*
**/.git
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/venv
**/*.egg-info
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/secrets
**/certs
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.crt
**/*.log
data
tests
